        {
          "id": 955302175,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Is it really necessary to introduce another variable for this? Or would it possible to search for qmake and determine the Qt version from there?",
          "author": {
            "id": 2498449,
            "username": "rknall",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Roland Knall",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
